</ul></nav></section><section class="front-matter"><div class="ameta p font-secondary font-xs">
<hgroup><h1>Attachment, recalled parental rearing, and ADHD symptoms predict emotion processing and alexithymia in adults with ADHD</h1></hgroup><div class="cg p">
<a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Edel%20MA"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id1"><span class="name western">Marc-Andreas Edel</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id1">
<h3><span class="name western">Marc-Andreas Edel</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>1</sup>Department of Psychiatry, LWL University Hospital, Ruhr University Bochum, Alexandrinenstraße 1-3, 44791 Bochum, Germany </div>
