</div>
</div>
<sup>1,</sup><sup>✉</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Edel%20S"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id2"><span class="name western">Susanne Edel</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id2">
<h3><span class="name western">Susanne Edel</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>3</sup>Psychiatry Clinic, St. Marien Hospital Eickel, Marienstr. 2, 44651 Herne, Germany </div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Edel%20S"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Susanne Edel</span></a>
</div>
</div>
